      "text": "Breakfast. Full-day excursion to the El Pedral penguin colony (from 15 September to 15 April only), an authentic experience among Magellanic penguins. Visit the Punta Ninfas Lighthouse, taste an excellent Patagonian roast lamb and admire the vast Patagonian landscapes above the sea at Estancia El Pedral. Return to the hotel.",
